    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Set on an impressive c.0.75 acre site, this charming 4-bedroom detached residence offers the perfect blend of tranquil rural living and excellent connectivity, with easy access to the nearby motorway.\n\nExtending to a well-proportioned and thoughtfully laid-out interior, the ground floor centres around a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen/dining/sitting area, ideal for modern family living. A sunroom to the rear floods the space with natural light and provides a seamless connection to the garden. A separate lounge offers a cosy retreat, perfect for relaxing or entertaining guests. Completing the ground floor is a versatile double bedroom and a family bathroom.\n\nUpstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms. The main bedroom benefits from a walk-in wardrobe, with the added advantage of plumbing already in place, offering excellent potential to convert this space into a stylish en-suite.\n\nThe outdoor space is a real highlight, with a south-facing rear garden designed to maximise sunlight throughout the day. A patio area provides the perfect setting for al fresco dining, while a timber shed offers practical storage. To the front, a pebbled driveway provides ample parking alongside a well-maintained lawn.\n\nThis is an ideal opportunity for those seeking a spacious family home in a peaceful setting, without compromising on convenience.\nOil Fired Central Heating \nWhite Goods included \nC 0.75 acre\nSouth facing rear Garden \nBlinds and light fittings included in Sale \nWrought Iron Gates\nGraveled Drive Way\nRadiator Covers included \nOil burner recently serviced\nStorage Timber Shed \nLawned Back Garden \nGranite Table and Benches included \nSeptic Tank\nWell - New Pump Serviced in Nov \n\nServices \nSeptic Tank\nWell - New Pump Serviced in Nov"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway Tiled Floor \nStairs to 1st floor \r\nLounge (15.49ft x 13.88ft) Carpet\nOpen Fire place \nBay Window \r\nKitchen/Dining (12.99ft x 12.86ft) Fitted Kitchen Units\nBreakfast Counter\nTiled Floor \nWhite Goods - Cooker, Fridge Freezer, Dishwasher, Washing Machine, Dryer \r\nUtility Room (8.30ft x 6.50ft) Tiled Floor ,\nStorage Press\nDoor to rear garden \r\nLiving Room (18.21ft x 10.53ft) Tiled Floor\nWood Burning Stove \r\nSunroom (11.71ft x 11.68ft) Tiled Floor \nFrench Doors to Patio area\r\nBedroom 2 (13.88ft x 13.09ft) Laminate Floor\r\nBathroom (8.23ft x 7.38ft) Tiled Floor \nShower\nBath WC WHB\r\nMaster Bedroom (18.21ft x 11.25ft) Carpet Floor\nWalk in Wardrobe - can be returned to Ensuite - all plumbing in room \n\r\nBedroom 3 (15.52ft x 13.94ft) Carpet \nWalk in Wardrobe\r\nBedroom 4 (12.47ft x 11.15ft) Carpet floor\r\nShower Room (9.19ft x 3.74ft) Tiled floor and walls \nShower\nWC\nWHB\r\nStore House Timber"
